    {
      "title": "جستجوی کتاب در پایگاه کتاب های درسی | پایگاه کتاب های درسی، اداره کل نظارت بر نشر و توزیع مواد آموزشی",
      "url": "http://chap.sch.ir/"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "6-3-3 structure since the 2012 reform: primary پایه اول to ششم (school: دبستان), first cycle of secondary پایه هفتم to نهم, second cycle پایه دهم to دوازدهم in theoretical (math-physics, experimental sciences, humanities, Islamic studies), technical-vocational and kardanesh branches. Older learners may still call Grades 7-9 راهنمایی (guidance school), the pre-2012 name, given as aliases. Source is the Ministry's official textbook database; medu.ir was unreachable from here."
